                "title": "Wave Portofino Lever with Carre Plate",
                "description": "The Wave Portofino Lever with Carre Plate is stunning  with its classic design that is best suited for larger doors in traditional homes. This Carre Tall Plate with Portofino Leverset is available in Grandeur Hardware's beautiful finish colors as a dummy, passage or privacy function. It will fit 1-3/8 inch to 2 inch thick doors with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. ",
                "keywords": "Portofino Leverset with Extra Tall Carre Plates, Grandeur Portofino Lever with Carre Roses, Portofino Wave Lever with Carre Tall Plates, Carre Tall Plate with Portofino Leversets, Wave Portofino Lever with Carre Plates, Grandeur CARPRT19 single dummy levers, Grandeur CARPRT24 double dummy levers, Grandeur CARPRT12 passage levers, Grandeur CARPRT42 privacy levers, GRA-CARPRT19, traditional leversets, lever sets with big rosettes, levers for big doors,"
